# Gitignored files copied into each new Claude worktree, which is otherwise
# a fresh checkout containing tracked files only. Uses .gitignore syntax.
# A file is copied only if it matches here AND is gitignored.
#
# Local run configuration only: what a worktree needs to start, which is
# endpoints, ports, and registry auth for a local install.
#
# Cloud credential files stay out. A service account JSON holds a private key
# for a real project, and nothing in a local run reads one, so copying it into
# every worktree would widen where that key sits without making anything work.
# A worktree that genuinely needs one should read it from outside the tree,
# through the path or the variable the cloud SDK already looks up.

.env
.env.*
.npmrc
